+// SHA-1 digest, signature; XeCryptBnQwBeSigVerify: hash, salt, signature) and was
+// confirmed with the real key ([xekeys-rsa][local]). A pin hashes a public
+// signature, never a key; any other input still needs the local key.
+constexpr const char* kOriginalSignatures[] = {
